Speeds up convex-test without changing what it accepts, refuses or returns.
See docs/test-suite-health.md (#717) and convex/convexTestHarness.test.ts.

- matchesValidator mirrors validateValidator case by case, so union members
  are tried without throwing. When upgrading convex-test, carry any change to
  either function into the other. Unknown validator types fall back to
  validateValidator.
- Committed document IDs are kept per table, so a query visits only its table.
- Each function's validators are exported once.
- Each stored document's size and JSON form are computed once.

- Declared full string-equality indexes use transaction-scoped buckets.
  Writes to their table and every transaction transition clear those buckets.
  Original range validation, comparisons and result handling remain authority.

